WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.600
Two things from Part 1
carry everything here.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.450
First, the four tracks.

3
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.937
People get their attributes from HR,
devices from device provisioning,

4
00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:12.131
servers from Arc onboarding
tags and Azure Policy,

5
00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:16.237
and non-person identities from
their owner's record, never from HR.

6
00:00:16.237 --> 00:00:18.950
Second, the store table, reduced.

7
00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.261
Extension attributes drive
user and device rules,

8
00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:27.463
custom security attributes feed
Conditional Access for applications but not

9
00:00:27.463 --> 00:00:32.350
dynamic rules, Intune's inventory feeds
filters, and Azure tags feed Policy.

10
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.425
Part 1 covered the HR track.

11
00:00:34.425 --> 00:00:35.760
Now the computers.
